WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to Manage Products. This guide highlights the dashboard controls and product tools.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Use the language button to switch between English and Spanish.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Use Appearance to switch between Light and Dark themes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Order opens the current customer order.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The menu button opens the main navigation.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The navigation contains Home, Menu, Tutorial, Manage products, Cappeto owner, and Sign out.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Choose Manage products to open the Product Library.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Open Product image, costs, and details to enter the image, name, category, costs, tax, delivery, quantity, selling price, VAT, date, and description.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Open the Horizontal financial menu to review purchases, sales, taxes, damaged goods, returns, and totals.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Open Inventory goods for sale to review stock and inventory changes. Return to the Cappeto Guide whenever you need help.
